WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:02.640
BE A TRAGEDY.

00:00:02.641 --> 00:00:04.842
IT'S EXACTLY WHAT IT IS.

00:00:04.843 --> 00:00:06.944
SPEAKING OF TRAGEDIES, IN THE

00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:09.680
EARLY 90s, SOMALIA WAS ROCKED

00:00:09.681 --> 00:00:12.416
BY WAR AND FAMINE, THE U.S. SENT

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:13.918
TROOPS NOT TO CONQUER LAND OR

00:00:13.919 --> 00:00:15.252
STEEL RESOURCES, BUT TO SAVE

00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:15.553
LIVES.

00:00:15.554 --> 00:00:17.988
WE DID THAT, SAVED ABOUT 100,000

00:00:17.989 --> 00:00:18.923
SOMALIS.

00:00:18.924 --> 00:00:22.860
THAT WAS 1993, KNIGHT 1992, I

00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:23.627
MISREMEMBERED IT.

00:00:23.628 --> 00:00:26.363
SEEMS LIKE JUST YESTERDAY.

00:00:26.364 --> 00:00:27.398
SOMALI AMERICAN CONGRESSWOMAN

00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:28.899
ILHAN OMAR IS NOT GRATEFUL FOR

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:29.567
WHAT THE U.S. DID ON BEHALF

00:00:29.568 --> 00:00:30.834
OF THE COUNTRY SHE WAS BORN IN.

00:00:30.835 --> 00:00:33.070
AND NO, SHE THINKS AMERICAN

00:00:33.071 --> 00:00:33.804
TROOPS ARE THE BAD GUYS IN THAT

00:00:33.805 --> 00:00:34.872
CONFLICT THAT A COUPLE OF YEARS

00:00:34.873 --> 00:00:36.740
AGO SHE RESPONDED ON TWITTER TO

00:00:36.741 --> 00:00:38.409
A USER WHO IS OR MIGHT BRING 19

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.244
AMERICAN TROOPS KILLED DURING

00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:42.780
THE BATTLE, SHE WROTE THIS "IN

00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:44.648
HIS SELECTIVE MEMORY, HE FORGETS

00:00:44.649 --> 00:00:46.417
TO ALSO MENTION THE THOUSANDS OF

00:00:46.418 --> 00:00:47.051
SOMALIS KILLED BY AMERICAN

00:00:47.052 --> 00:00:53.991
FORCES THAT DAY!

00:00:53.992 --> 00:00:54.491
#NotTodaySatan ."

00:00:54.492 --> 00:00:55.893
SERGEANT MAJOR KYLE LAM THOUGHT

00:00:55.894 --> 00:00:57.661
THAT DAY IN THE BATTLE, THE

00:00:57.662 --> 00:01:00.731
AUTHOR OF THE BOOK "LEADERSHIP

00:01:00.732 --> 00:01:02.399
IN THE SHADOWS," AND WE'RE HAPPY

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.001
TO HAVE THEM TONIGHT.

00:01:04.002 --> 00:01:05.803
THANK YOU VERY MUCH FOR COMING

00:01:05.804 --> 00:01:06.203
ON TONIGHT.

00:01:06.204 --> 00:01:09.173
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME.

00:01:09.174 --> 00:01:11.041
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHEN YOU READ ILHAN

00:01:11.042 --> 00:01:11.909
OMAR'S REMARKS ABOUT THE BATTLE

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:14.345
HE FOUGHT IN, WHAT IS YOUR

00:01:14.346 --> 00:01:14.712
RESPONSE?

00:01:14.713 --> 00:01:15.479
&gt;&gt; NORMALLY IT IS HUMOROUS, BUT

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:18.182
AT THIS POINT, IT IS KIND OF

00:01:18.183 --> 00:01:18.782
DISTURBING.

00:01:18.783 --> 00:01:20.217
FIRST OF ALL, SHE WASN'T THERE,

00:01:20.218 --> 00:01:20.884
SHE HAD ALREADY LEFT THE

00:01:20.885 --> 00:01:21.218
COUNTRY.

00:01:21.219 --> 00:01:24.989
WE WERE THERE, AND I'VE NEVER

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:25.623
HEARD NUMBERS QUITE THAT

00:01:25.624 --> 00:01:25.990
INFLATED.

00:01:25.991 --> 00:01:28.092
WE WISH WE COULD HAVE DONE THAT

00:01:28.093 --> 00:01:29.727
MUCH DAMAGE, BUT THAT DIDN'T

00:01:29.728 --> 00:01:31.662
HAPPEN AS FAR AS I KNOW.

00:01:31.663 --> 00:01:33.397
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT IS SO STRIKING

00:01:33.398 --> 00:01:34.965
IS, AND THE U.S. HAS DONE THINGS

00:01:34.966 --> 00:01:36.133
I DISAGREE WITH AROUND THE

00:01:36.134 --> 00:01:38.202
WORLD, BUT IN THIS CASE, IT

00:01:38.203 --> 00:01:38.902
SEEMS LIKE THE MISSION WAS

00:01:38.903 --> 00:01:40.871
PURELY ALTRUISTIC.

00:01:40.872 --> 00:01:42.806
WE WERE ONLY THERE TO HELP THERE

00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:43.407
WE DIDN'T TAKE SOMALIA.

00:01:43.408 --> 00:01:45.442
DID YOU STEAL GOLD OR NATURAL

00:01:45.443 --> 00:01:46.176
RESOURCES WHEN YOU WERE THERE?

00:01:46.177 --> 00:01:47.845
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHS]

00:01:47.846 --> 00:01:48.479
WE DIDN'T DO THAT.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.749
WE ARE TRYING TO TAKE OUT A CLAN

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:52.783
LEADER THAT HAD TAKEN OVER THE

00:01:52.784 --> 00:01:56.453
TOWN, THEY WERE TAKING THE FOOD,

00:01:56.454 --> 00:01:59.256
ANY OF THE AID WE WERE GIVING TO

00:01:59.257 --> 00:02:03.560
SOMALIA, ALSO WEAPONS, RUNNING

00:02:03.561 --> 00:02:06.630
DRUGS, A BIG DRUG OVER THERE.

00:02:06.631 --> 00:02:08.599
HE NEEDED TO BE ELIMINATED, SO

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:09.600
WE COULD GET PEACE BACK IN THAT

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:10.067
TOWN.

00:02:10.068 --> 00:02:11.769
WE WERE ACTUALLY THERE TO HELP

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.437
SOME OF THE LESSER TRIBES, THE

00:02:13.438 --> 00:02:16.640
LESSER CLANS, SUCH AS HER CLAN,

00:02:16.641 --> 00:02:17.841
WHICH OBVIOUSLY THEY WERE

00:02:17.842 --> 00:02:18.609
ALREADY GONE.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:19.810
BUT WE WERE THERE TO TRY TO DO

00:02:19.811 --> 00:02:20.611
THE RIGHT THING.

00:02:20.612 --> 00:02:22.346
THE OTHER THING IS, WE DIDN'T

00:02:22.347 --> 00:02:23.747
SAY "HEY, LET'S PICK OUT SOMALIA

00:02:23.748 --> 00:02:26.984
IS A GREAT PLACE TO GO HANG

00:02:26.985 --> 00:02:27.351
OUT."

00:02:27.352 --> 00:02:28.986
THE PRESIDENT OF THE TIME,

00:02:28.987 --> 00:02:29.720
PRESIDENT CLINTON, SAID THIS IS

00:02:29.721 --> 00:02:31.388
WHERE WE ARE GOING, THIS IS THE

00:02:31.389 --> 00:02:32.690
MISSION, AND OUR COMMANDER SAID

00:02:32.691 --> 00:02:34.558
"ROGER THAT, WE CAN DO IT," AND

00:02:34.559 --> 00:02:35.759
WILL SIGN ON THE LINE.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.861
THAT IS WHY WE SERVED.

00:02:37.862 --> 00:02:38.629
YOU CAN MAKE A DIFFERENCE AND

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:41.565
YOU GO TO THOSE COUNTRIES.

00:02:41.566 --> 00:02:43.000
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DOES IT STRIKE YOU

00:02:43.001 --> 00:02:44.868
AS ODD, I DON'T WANT TO PICK ON

00:02:44.869 --> 00:02:45.803
ILHAN OMAR, BUT SHE IS A MEMBER

00:02:45.804 --> 00:02:49.239
OF CONGRESS, AND SO HER

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.641
STATEMENTS GET A LOT OF

00:02:50.642 --> 00:02:51.008
ATTENTION.

00:02:51.009 --> 00:02:51.709
HERE'S SOMEONE WHO WAS BROUGHT

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.977
TO THE UNITED STATES AT PUBLIC

00:02:53.978 --> 00:02:55.746
EXPENSE SIMPLY BECAUSE WE ARE A

00:02:55.747 --> 00:02:56.480
KIND COUNTRY THAT ACCEPTS A LOT

00:02:56.481 --> 00:02:58.182
OF REFUGEES, AND RATHER THAN

00:02:58.183 --> 00:03:00.184
BEING GRATEFUL FOR THAT, SHE

00:03:00.185 --> 00:03:02.186
SPENT THE REST OF HER LIFE

00:03:02.187 --> 00:03:04.288
ATTACKING THIS COUNTRY.

00:03:04.289 --> 00:03:05.355
WHY?

00:03:05.356 --> 00:03:07.324
&gt;&gt; AS THEY WOULD SAY DOWN HERE

00:03:07.325 --> 00:03:10.394
IN TENNESSEE, BLESS HER HEART.

00:03:10.395 --> 00:03:12.329
WE WANT HER TO UNDERSTAND THAT

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.498
SHE IS LIVING LARGE NOW BECAUSE

00:03:14.499 --> 00:03:17.000
OF HER FAMILY BEING ABLE TO

00:03:17.001 --> 00:03:22.172
ESCAPE THE ATROCITIES OF

00:03:22.173 --> 00:03:22.740
MOGADISHU.

00:03:22.741 --> 00:03:23.807
IT IS DISTURBING, WE WATCH OUR

00:03:23.808 --> 00:03:25.075
FRIENDS GET DRUG THROUGH THE

00:03:25.076 --> 00:03:25.809
STREETS BY THE PEOPLE SHE SAYS

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.412
ARE HER PEOPLE.

00:03:28.413 --> 00:03:32.116
WE GOT TO WATCH THAT ON TV, ONCE

00:03:32.117 --> 00:03:33.550
WE GOT FROM THE CRASH SITE I WAS

00:03:33.551 --> 00:03:34.752
OUT AND GOT BACK TO OUR HANGER,

00:03:34.753 --> 00:03:36.420
THAT IS WHAT WE GOT TO WATCH.

00:03:36.421 --> 00:03:39.590
YEAH, WE TAKE IT PERSONAL WHEN

00:03:39.591 --> 00:03:41.725
YOU ATTACK US LIKE THAT.

00:03:41.726 --> 00:03:43.560
ONCE AGAIN, IT IS NOT SURPRISING

00:03:43.561 --> 00:03:44.128
TO HEAR THAT.

00:03:44.129 --> 00:03:46.196
THERE HAS BEEN KIND OF A LONG

00:03:46.197 --> 00:03:47.631
LIST OF THINGS SHE SAID, I DON'T

00:03:47.632 --> 00:03:49.032
KNOW IF SHE MEANT THEM OR NOT,

00:03:49.033 --> 00:03:52.202
BUT SHE CONTINUES TO SAY THEM.

00:03:52.203 --> 00:03:53.737
YEAH, I FEEL BAD FOR HER.

00:03:53.738 --> 00:03:55.806
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEAH, I DO TOO.

00:03:55.807 --> 00:03:57.007
WHAT ABOUT THE FAMILIES OF

00:03:57.008 --> 00:03:58.208
AMERICANS WHO WERE KILLED THERE?

00:03:58.209 --> 00:04:00.744
WHAT DO YOU THINK THEY THINK OF

00:04:00.745 --> 00:04:01.178
THIS?

00:04:01.179 --> 00:04:03.147
&gt;&gt; I HAVEN'T TALKED TO ANY OF

00:04:03.148 --> 00:04:03.847
THE FAMILIES, BUT IT DOESN'T

00:04:03.848 --> 00:04:06.750
TAKE HER SAYING SOMETHING TO

00:04:06.751 --> 00:04:07.651
REMIND THEM OF WHAT THEY DEAL

00:04:07.652 --> 00:04:09.453
WITH EVERY DAY.

00:04:09.454 --> 00:04:10.921
WHENEVER THEY GO TO A BASEBALL

00:04:10.922 --> 00:04:12.055
GAME AND THEY HEAR THE

00:04:12.056 --> 00:04:12.790
NATIONAL ANTHEM, THEY LOOK AT

00:04:12.791 --> 00:04:15.325
THE FLAG, THAT DAD IS NOT THERE

00:04:15.326 --> 00:04:19.429
WITH HIS KIDS.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:21.398
THAT'S A STORY, NOT JUST FROM

00:04:21.399 --> 00:04:22.800
SOMALIA, BUT ALL THE OTHER

00:04:22.801 --> 00:04:23.867
CONFLICTS I HAVE BEEN IN, AND

00:04:23.868 --> 00:04:25.002
THAT I HAVEN'T BEEN IN, THAT IS

00:04:25.003 --> 00:04:27.604
THE STORY OF A SOLDIER.

00:04:27.605 --> 00:04:29.039
THAT IS WHAT WE DEAL WITH ON A

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:29.606
DAILY BASIS.

00:04:29.607 --> 00:04:32.075
AND REALLY, WE JUST WANT PEOPLE

00:04:32.076 --> 00:04:33.944
TO HELP US OUT WHEN WE GET BACK,

00:04:33.945 --> 00:04:35.345
WHICH REASON WE NEED A MISSION,

00:04:35.346 --> 00:04:36.780
GUYS TO GET HELP IF THEY HAVE

00:04:36.781 --> 00:04:38.282
DRUG OR ALCOHOL ISSUES, WHICH

00:04:38.283 --> 00:04:40.584
SOMETIMES CAN BE PREVALENT IN

00:04:40.585 --> 00:04:41.919
THE MILITARY IF GUYS ARE

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.086
SUFFERING WITH INJURIES THAT

00:04:43.087 --> 00:04:44.521
THEY TRY TO CONTINUE TO FIGHT

00:04:44.522 --> 00:04:45.189
WITH.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:46.824
WE TRY TO GET THEM THE HELP WE

00:04:46.825 --> 00:04:50.961
CAN, THAT IS WHAT WE WANT TO DO.

00:04:50.962 --> 00:04:54.364
YEAH, IT IS THE SOLDIER'S STORY

00:04:54.365 --> 00:04:55.799
FROM THE LAST 10,000 YEARS.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.202
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE LAST THING YOU

